    editTier: "bestseller",
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Vertex Speed Low Shoe", "bodyKo": "클라이밍에 필요한 요소와 마운틴 러닝 슈즈의 효율성을 결합한 이 진보적인 하이브리드 슈즈와 함께 오르세요. 단단한 암벽을 단단히 잡고 부드러운 트레일 지형에서 접지력을 제공하는 존드 아웃솔, 안정감을 유지하면서 발밑 감각을 살려주는 충격 흡수 쿠셔닝 덕분에 테크니컬 오르막은 빠르게 오르고 내리막은 편안하게 내려올 수 있습니다. 로우 프로파일의 신축성 니트 칼라가 이물질 유입을 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "통기성 · 경량 · 내구성 · 내마모성", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Lacing system provides a smooth pull and secure midfoot fit while preventing backslip · Tongue pocket secures the laces, eliminates lace bounce, and prevents snagging · Flexible laminated TPU reinforcement zones add protection and abrasion resistance · Stretch materials extend from collar to U-throat for a precise sock-like fit · Mapped dual-density midsole construction combines softer heel and midfoot cushioning for running comfort with firmer forefoot support for rocky terrain · Abrasion-resistant PFAS-free Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · Knit collar seals out debris", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Offset (Stack height): 7mm (23mm : 16mm) · Zonal lug patterns are specifically designed to provide forefoot grip while smearing with comfort and surefootedness on the trail", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® Megagrip outsole with LITEBASE technology delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions while shedding every gram possible · Outsole and midsole zones integrate for optimal response and performance · Forefoot TPU film provides underfoot protection and improved stability", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009715/black-arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: 통기성 · 경량 · 내구성 · 내마모성", "신발 제작: Lacing system provides a smooth pull and secure midfoot fit while preventing backslip · Tongue pocket secures the laces, eliminates lace bounce, and prevents snagging · Flexible laminated TPU reinforcement zones add protection and abrasion resistance · Stretch materials extend from collar to U-throat for a precise sock-like fit · Mapped dual-density midsole construction combines softer heel and midfoot cushioning for running comfort with firmer forefoot support for rocky terrain · Abrasion-resistant PFAS-free Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · Knit collar seals out debris", "신발 기하학: Offset (Stack height): 7mm (23mm : 16mm) · Zonal lug patterns are specifically designed to provide forefoot grip while smearing with comfort and surefootedness on the trail", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® Megagrip outsole with LITEBASE technology delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions while shedding every gram possible · Outsole and midsole zones integrate for optimal response and performance · Forefoot TPU film provides underfoot protection and improved stability", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
