    editTier: "bestseller",
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Vertex Alpine GTX Shoe", "bodyKo": "Vertex Alpine GTX는 어프로치 슈즈를 완전히 다시 생각한 제품입니다. 트레일 러닝화의 핏과 성능, 기술적인 지형에서 오랜 시간 동안 필요한 안정성의 균형을 맞춘 이 제품은 가볍고 빠르며 방수 기능이 있으며 지지력과 보호 기능을 결합하여 안전하고 편안한 승차감을 제공합니다. 전체 GORE-TEX 라이너는 젖음과 눈을 막아주며, 끈적끈적한 Vibram XS Flash 2 밑창은 습하고 건조한 조건에서 가장자리, 트레일 성능, 접지력을 위해 설계되었습니다. TPU 생크와 발가락 캡이 보호 기능을 강화하고 니트 칼라가 잔해를 막아줍니다. 비방수 버전이 필요하신가요? Vertex 알파인 슈즈를 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Supportive construction · Abrasion resistant", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Integrated tongue pocket tucks away laces to prevent snags and untying · EVA/Polyolefin blended midsole features higher abrasion component in the forefoot for scrambling · Toe cap adds protection and abrasion resistance · GORE-TEX® provides waterproof and breathable performance · Knit collar seals out debris and integrates with the tongue to create a secure, comfortable sock-like fit · Integrated carabiner attachment points for easy transport · TPU shank provides underfoot protection and stiffness for improved stability · Cordura® recycled PES", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Ergonomically patterned 4mm lugs · Offset (Stack height): 8mm (18mm : 10mm)", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Tread is specifically designed to provide grip while edging and offer on-trail traction with climbing performance", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009602/black-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Waterproof · Breathable · Lightweight · Durable · Supportive construction · Abrasion resistant", "신발 제작: Integrated tongue pocket tucks away laces to prevent snags and untying · EVA/Polyolefin blended midsole features higher abrasion component in the forefoot for scrambling · Toe cap adds protection and abrasion resistance · GORE-TEX® provides waterproof and breathable performance · Knit collar seals out debris and integrates with the tongue to create a secure, comfortable sock-like fit · Integrated carabiner attachment points for easy transport · TPU shank provides underfoot protection and stiffness for improved stability · Cordura® recycled PES", "신발 기하학: Ergonomically patterned 4mm lugs · Offset (Stack height): 8mm (18mm : 10mm)", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Tread is specifically designed to provide grip while edging and offer on-trail traction with climbing performance", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
