    editTier: "new",
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Konseal Trek Boot", "bodyKo": "Konseal Trek은 스크램블링, 클라이밍, 무거운 배낭을 멘 하이킹처럼 등반만큼이나 까다로운 어프로치를 위해 제작되었습니다. 반응성 좋은 보행감과 가장자리의 추가 러그가 고르지 않은 지형, 너덜지대, 눈 위에서 안정성과 든든한 그립을 제공하며, 미드컷 칼라는 이물질을 막고 무거운 장비를 벽까지 운반할 때 필요한 발목 지지력을 더합니다. 아웃솔의 다중 높이 접지 패턴은 슬랩에서 스미어링하고 부드러운 지면을 내려올 때도 똑같이 자신감 있는 움직임을 지원하며, 마모에 강한 어퍼는 혹독한 알파인 환경을 장시간 견뎌냅니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/black-graphite/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Weather protective · Forefoot grip for climbing rock and heel traction for hiking down soft surfaces · Ankle support for trekking with heavy packs", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/black-graphite/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Mid-height collar adds support and helps seal out debris · Nubuck leather upper for breathable, durable performance over challenging terrain · Improved heel hold for precise foot movement and blister prevention · Extended lacing reaches to toe area for customized fit · Compressed EVA midsole foam provides a mix of comfort for long treks and control on uneven, technical terrain · GORE-TEX® upper membrane keeps your feet dry without sacrificing breathability · Endure overlays extend rubber coverage up the side of the shoe to protect against rock abrasion and other trail features · Molded TPU bumper shields your toes and feet from the impact of rocks and other obstacles", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/black-graphite/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Drop (Stack): 12.5mm (35mm : 22.5mm) · 5.1mm lugs", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/mid-bracken-graphite/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® MegaGrip™ rubber compound is durable and grippy · Multi-height traction pattern on the outsole includes a forefoot climbing zone for smearing up rock and a heel traction zone for hiking downhill · Extra lugs around the perimeter add traction on uneven terrain", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/mid-bracken-graphite/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/black-graphite/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Outsole: Rubber · Insole: Synthetic · Upper: Textile/Synthetic/Leather", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/black-graphite/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010504/mid-bracken-graphite/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Durable · Weather protective · Forefoot grip for climbing rock and heel traction for hiking down soft surfaces · Ankle support for trekking with heavy packs", "신발 제작: Mid-height collar adds support and helps seal out debris · Nubuck leather upper for breathable, durable performance over challenging terrain · Improved heel hold for precise foot movement and blister prevention · Extended lacing reaches to toe area for customized fit · Compressed EVA midsole foam provides a mix of comfort for long treks and control on uneven, technical terrain · GORE-TEX® upper membrane keeps your feet dry without sacrificing breathability · Endure overlays extend rubber coverage up the side of the shoe to protect against rock abrasion and other trail features · Molded TPU bumper shields your toes and feet from the impact of rocks and other obstacles", "신발 기하학: Drop (Stack): 12.5mm (35mm : 22.5mm) · 5.1mm lugs", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® MegaGrip™ rubber compound is durable and grippy · Multi-height traction pattern on the outsole includes a forefoot climbing zone for smearing up rock and a heel traction zone for hiking downhill · Extra lugs around the perimeter add traction on uneven terrain", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Outsole: Rubber · Insole: Synthetic · Upper: Textile/Synthetic/Leather", "관리: Surface clean only"],
