    registeredAt: "2026-08-24T11:51:06.000Z",
    editTier: "bestseller",
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Vertex Alpine Shoe", "bodyKo": "트레일 러닝화의 핏과 성능과 길고 기술적인 접근 방식에 필요한 안정성의 균형을 맞춘 Vertex Alpine은 접근 방식 신발을 재정의합니다. 하루 종일 산악 여행을 위해 제작된 이 제품은 가볍고 빠르며 험준하고 다양한 지형에 필요한 지지력과 보호 기능을 제공합니다. 끈적끈적한 Vibram XS Flash 2 밑창은 습하고 건조한 조건에서 가장자리, 트레일 성능, 그립력을 위해 설계되었습니다. TPU 생크와 발가락 캡이 보호 기능을 강화하고 니트 칼라가 잔해를 막아줍니다. 방수 버전이 필요하십니까? Vertex 알파인 GTX 슈를 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/black-solaris/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Lightweight · Durable · Supportive construction · Abrasion resistant", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/black-solaris/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Integrated tongue pocket tucks away laces to prevent snags and untying · EVA/Polyolefin blended midsole features higher abrasion component in the forefoot for scrambling · Toe cap adds protection and abrasion resistance · Knit collar seals out debris and integrates with the tongue to create a secure, comfortable sock-like fit · Abrasion-resistant Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · TPU shank provides underfoot protection and stiffness for improved stability", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/black-solaris/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Ergonomically patterned 4mm lugs · Offset (Stack height): 8mm (18mm : 10mm)", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/solitude-dk-solitude/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Tread is specifically designed to provide grip while edging and offer on-trail traction with climbing performance", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/solitude-dk-solitude/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/solitude-dk-solitude/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/black-solaris/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009019/black-solaris/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Lightweight · Durable · Supportive construction · Abrasion resistant", "신발 제작: Integrated tongue pocket tucks away laces to prevent snags and untying · EVA/Polyolefin blended midsole features higher abrasion component in the forefoot for scrambling · Toe cap adds protection and abrasion resistance · Knit collar seals out debris and integrates with the tongue to create a secure, comfortable sock-like fit · Abrasion-resistant Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · TPU shank provides underfoot protection and stiffness for improved stability", "신발 기하학: Ergonomically patterned 4mm lugs · Offset (Stack height): 8mm (18mm : 10mm)", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Tread is specifically designed to provide grip while edging and offer on-trail traction with climbing performance", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
