    editTier: "bestseller",
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Kragg Shoe", "bodyKo": "Capable on the approach. Comfortable between climbs. The updated Kragg is a one-shoe solution built for both. A protective toe cap and hiking outsole offer protection and grip as you hike in and out over trails and rocks, and a roomier, more breathable upper helps maximize comfort once you’re at the crag. The collapsible heel has been redesigned for quicker exit and entry—so you can transition from climb mode to recovery or belay mode with ease. What's been updated: Updated with an engineered knit collapsible heel for slip-on ease and improved fit, stretch knit construction for enhanced breathability and entry, and jacquard woven upper for added durability and airflow.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/black-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Lightweight · Abrasion resistant · Collapsible heel allows shoe to be worn as a camp and belay slipper", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/black-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Moulded rubber toe cap provides protection · Redesigned engineered knit collapsible heel with integrated pull tab improves fit and slip-on ease · Improved stretch-knit runway down the upper enhances ease of entry and breathability · New engineered jacquard woven upper improves breathability and durability · INSITE PU drop-in midsole for cushion, comfort, and stability while hiking", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/black-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "2mm lugs · Drop (Stack): 7mm (24mm : 17mm)", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/black-black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® Megagrip outsole delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions · Lug design optimized for traction on soft surfaces and grip on rocks", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/sea-salt-sea-salt/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/sea-salt-sea-salt/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber · Insole: Synthetic", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/sea-salt-sea-salt/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010078/oakmoss-oakmoss/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Breathable · Lightweight · Abrasion resistant · Collapsible heel allows shoe to be worn as a camp and belay slipper", "신발 제작: Moulded rubber toe cap provides protection · Redesigned engineered knit collapsible heel with integrated pull tab improves fit and slip-on ease · Improved stretch-knit runway down the upper enhances ease of entry and breathability · New engineered jacquard woven upper improves breathability and durability · INSITE PU drop-in midsole for cushion, comfort, and stability while hiking", "신발 기하학: 2mm lugs · Drop (Stack): 7mm (24mm : 17mm)", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® Megagrip outsole delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions · Lug design optimized for traction on soft surfaces and grip on rocks", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber · Insole: Synthetic", "관리: Surface clean only"],
