    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Vertex Speed Shoe", "bodyKo": "등반의 특정 요구 사항과 산악용 러닝화의 효율성을 결합한 이 진보적인 하이브리드 신발을 신고 등반을 해보세요. 단단한 암석 표면을 잡고 부드러운 트레일 지형에서 견인력을 제공하는 구역별 아웃솔과 안정감을 유지하고 발 아래 지면을 느낄 수 있게 해주는 충격 흡수 발 밑 쿠션 덕분에 기술적인 오르막길을 날아오르고 편안하게 뒤로 내려올 수 있습니다. 내장된 신축성 있는 각반은 잔해물을 밀봉하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 더 빠른 속도가 필요하십니까? Sylan 2 신발을 사용해 보세요.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "통기성 · 경량 · 내구성 · 내마모성", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Abrasion-resistant Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · Lacing system provides a smooth pull and secure midfoot fit while preventing backslip · Tongue pocket secures the laces, eliminates lace bounce, and prevents snagging · Flexible laminated TPU reinforcement zones add protection and abrasion resistance · Stretch materials extend from collar to U-throat for a precise sock-like fit · Mapped dual-density midsole construction combines softer heel and midfoot cushioning for running comfort with firmer forefoot support for rocky terrain · Highly breathable integrated stretch gaiter helps seal out debris and moisture", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Offset (Stack height): 7mm (23mm : 16mm) · Zonal lug patterns are specifically designed to provide forefoot grip while smearing with comfort and surefootedness on the trail", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® Megagrip outsole with LITEBASE technology delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions while shedding every gram possible · Outsole and midsole zones integrate for optimal response and performance · Forefoot TPU film provides underfoot protection and improved stability", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009619/black-atmos/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: 통기성 · 경량 · 내구성 · 내마모성", "신발 제작: Abrasion-resistant Matryx® woven polyester upper is durable, lightweight, breathable, and flexible · Lacing system provides a smooth pull and secure midfoot fit while preventing backslip · Tongue pocket secures the laces, eliminates lace bounce, and prevents snagging · Flexible laminated TPU reinforcement zones add protection and abrasion resistance · Stretch materials extend from collar to U-throat for a precise sock-like fit · Mapped dual-density midsole construction combines softer heel and midfoot cushioning for running comfort with firmer forefoot support for rocky terrain · Highly breathable integrated stretch gaiter helps seal out debris and moisture", "신발 기하학: Offset (Stack height): 7mm (23mm : 16mm) · Zonal lug patterns are specifically designed to provide forefoot grip while smearing with comfort and surefootedness on the trail", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® Megagrip outsole with LITEBASE technology delivers durable, surefooted performance across a range of conditions while shedding every gram possible · Outsole and midsole zones integrate for optimal response and performance · Forefoot TPU film provides underfoot protection and improved stability", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
