    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Konseal GTX Shoe", "bodyKo": "거친 백패킹, 4급 클라이밍, 도강까지 다양한 어프로치에서 Konseal GTX는 모든 상황에 대응합니다. 단단하고 안정적인 보행감은 고르지 않은 지형, 너덜지대, 눈 위에서 뛰어난 성능을 발휘하며, 벽까지 무거운 장비를 운반할 때도 든든합니다. 마모에 강한 어퍼는 GORE-TEX 기술을 적용해 혹독한 알파인 환경에서도 방수성과 통기성을 모두 제공하며, 다목적 아웃솔은 슬랩에서 스미어링하고 부드러운 지면을 내려올 때도 똑같이 자신감 있는 성능을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/black-black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Stable with heavy loads", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/black-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Compressed EVA midsole provides lasting cushion and support · Extended lacing · Improved heel hold for precise foot movement and blister prevention · Carbon fibre midsole shank adds stability and stiffness needed to handle heavy loads · DWR coated over-lasted construction wraps the midsole in an abrasion-resistant compound for added durability · Nubuck leather upper with GTX membrane for waterproof, breathable, and durable performance over challenging terrain · Forefoot grip for climbing rock and heel traction for hiking down", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/black-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "4mm lugs · Drop (Stack): 11mm (24mm : 13mm)", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/lt-rune-void-tt/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Dual-purpose lugged outsole with a forefoot climbing zone optimized for smearing up rock and separate traction on the heel for hiking downhill", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/lt-rune-void-tt/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/lt-rune-void-tt/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Leather · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/black-black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000009972/black-black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Durable · Stable with heavy loads", "신발 제작: Compressed EVA midsole provides lasting cushion and support · Extended lacing · Improved heel hold for precise foot movement and blister prevention · Carbon fibre midsole shank adds stability and stiffness needed to handle heavy loads · DWR coated over-lasted construction wraps the midsole in an abrasion-resistant compound for added durability · Nubuck leather upper with GTX membrane for waterproof, breathable, and durable performance over challenging terrain · Forefoot grip for climbing rock and heel traction for hiking down", "신발 기하학: 4mm lugs · Drop (Stack): 11mm (24mm : 13mm)", "신발 밑창 구조: Vibram® XS Flash 2 outsole delivers outstanding grip and durable, sure-footed performance across a range of conditions · Dual-purpose lugged outsole with a forefoot climbing zone optimized for smearing up rock and separate traction on the heel for hiking downhill", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Leather · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
