    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Kopec Mid GTX Boot", "bodyKo": "민첩하고 가벼우면서도 지지력과 편안함을 갖춘 Kopec Mid GTX는 다양한 지형에서 자신 있게 이동할 수 있는 사계절 하이킹 부츠입니다. 당일 하이킹과 미니멀한 며칠간의 트레킹을 위해 설계되었으며, PFAS 무첨가 GORE-TEX 보호 기능이 물과 눈을 막아줍니다. CORDURA 메쉬 어퍼는 내구성과 경량성을 갖췄고, 성형 패드가 발목을 보호하며, 넓은 토 박스는 발가락을 자연스럽게 펼칠 공간을 제공합니다. 이중 밀도 미드솔이 쿠셔닝과 지지력을 제공하고, Vibram Megagrip 아웃솔과 커스텀 러그 패턴이 안정적인 접지력을 선사합니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/atmos-dk-arctic-silk/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Waterproof · Breathable · Durable", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/atmos-dk-arctic-silk/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Articulated Ultralon® 3D moulded collar and tongue combine support and protection with exceptional agility, fit, and freedom · Dual-density midsole material and construction combine cushioning with lasting shock absorption and support for all-day comfort and stability on rugged terrain · Specially designed TPU midfoot shank offers torsional support and underfoot protection for minimal weight · Extended U-throat construction provides more flex, better breathability, greater comfort · Waterproof, breathable GORE-TEX® ePE fabric protection with a reduced carbon footprint · Highly durable CORDURA® mesh upper delivers lightweight, breathable, quick-drying performance · Moulded malleolus pad protects the ankle · Roomy toe box accommodates splay and protects toes · Lacing system utilizes integrated webbing with durable metal eyelets at the top to create a secure, supportive, comfortable fit · Asymmetric molded TPU toe cap and reinforcements at high-wear zones add protection and durability · External molded TPU heel counter adds support and protection", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/atmos-dk-arctic-silk/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "고급 러그 형상은 다양한 표면에 정밀한 그립을 제공하고 진흙을 흘리며 쉬운 보폭을 촉진합니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/black-black/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "LITEBASE 기술이 적용된 Vibram® Megagrip 아웃솔은 가능한 모든 무게를 줄이면서 다양한 조건에서 내구성과 확실한 발 성능을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/black-black/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/black-black/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/alpine-blue-grey-lt-forage/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "Surface clean only", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010031/alpine-blue-grey-lt-forage/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Waterproof · Breathable · Durable", "신발 제작: Articulated Ultralon® 3D moulded collar and tongue combine support and protection with exceptional agility, fit, and freedom · Dual-density midsole material and construction combine cushioning with lasting shock absorption and support for all-day comfort and stability on rugged terrain · Specially designed TPU midfoot shank offers torsional support and underfoot protection for minimal weight · Extended U-throat construction provides more flex, better breathability, greater comfort · Waterproof, breathable GORE-TEX® ePE fabric protection with a reduced carbon footprint · Highly durable CORDURA® mesh upper delivers lightweight, breathable, quick-drying performance · Moulded malleolus pad protects the ankle · Roomy toe box accommodates splay and protects toes · Lacing system utilizes integrated webbing with durable metal eyelets at the top to create a secure, supportive, comfortable fit · Asymmetric molded TPU toe cap and reinforcements at high-wear zones add protection and durability · External molded TPU heel counter adds support and protection", "신발 기하학: 고급 러그 형상은 다양한 표면에 정밀한 그립을 제공하고 진흙을 흘리며 쉬운 보폭을 촉진합니다.", "신발 밑창 구조: LITEBASE 기술이 적용된 Vibram® Megagrip 아웃솔은 가능한 모든 무게를 줄이면서 다양한 조건에서 내구성과 확실한 발 성능을 제공합니다.", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
