    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Sylan 2 Shoe", "bodyKo": "Built for confident speed, this shoe is for trail runners looking to move fast and maximize efficiency. The rockered shape of the midsole propels you from foot strike to toe-off, while an ultra-responsive supercritical foam compound maximizes energy return and reduces fatigue—helping you stay in PR mode all day long. A carbon-fibre plate adds extra stability so you can let it rip on uneven terrain with confidence, and outsole lugs provide solid trail traction and kick off excess dirt. Need more stability for technical terrain? Try the Vertex Speed Shoe .", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/atmos-atmos/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "기술적 특징", "bodyKo": "Responsive for efficiency and reduced fatigue · Propulsive yet stable · Comfortable for long efforts", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/atmos-atmos/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 제작", "bodyKo": "Integrated flat-knit tongue construction optimizes foot containment and improves airflow for breathability on hard efforts · Superlight engineered woven upper for reduced weight and improved breathability · Rockered midsole with responsive new supercritical foam compound maximizes propulsion and energy return · Carbon-fibre plate in the midsole adds stability on trail terrain · Flat-knit collar deflects debris from entry and improves fit · Supercritical foam compound improves underfoot protection and reduces fatigue", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/atmos-atmos/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 기하학", "bodyKo": "Stepped 4.5mm/3.5mm lugs provide optimized traction on trails plus improved dirt shedding · Drop (Stack): 6mm (31.5mm : 25.5mm)", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/shincha-shincha/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "신발 밑창 구조", "bodyKo": "LITEBASE 기술이 적용된 Vibram® Megagrip 아웃솔은 가능한 모든 무게를 줄이면서 다양한 조건에서 내구성과 확실한 발 성능을 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/shincha-shincha/3.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "로고 및 라벨 구성", "bodyKo": "The colours Shincha/Shincha, Mallow/Mallow, Luminary/Luminary, SL Dark Jade/SL Dark Jade, and Graphite/Graphite have a large Arc'teryx Bird logo on the side · The colours Atmos/Atmos and Black/Black have a smaller Arc'teryx Bird logo on the heel", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/shincha-shincha/5.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속 가능성", "bodyKo": "PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/sl-larch-sl-larch/1.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber", "image": "/products/ax-pdp/X000010153/sl-larch-sl-larch/3.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["기술적 특징: Responsive for efficiency and reduced fatigue · Propulsive yet stable · Comfortable for long efforts", "신발 제작: Integrated flat-knit tongue construction optimizes foot containment and improves airflow for breathability on hard efforts · Superlight engineered woven upper for reduced weight and improved breathability · Rockered midsole with responsive new supercritical foam compound maximizes propulsion and energy return · Carbon-fibre plate in the midsole adds stability on trail terrain · Flat-knit collar deflects debris from entry and improves fit · Supercritical foam compound improves underfoot protection and reduces fatigue", "신발 기하학: Stepped 4.5mm/3.5mm lugs provide optimized traction on trails plus improved dirt shedding · Drop (Stack): 6mm (31.5mm : 25.5mm)", "신발 밑창 구조: LITEBASE 기술이 적용된 Vibram® Megagrip 아웃솔은 가능한 모든 무게를 줄이면서 다양한 조건에서 내구성과 확실한 발 성능을 제공합니다.", "로고 및 라벨 구성: The colours Shincha/Shincha, Mallow/Mallow, Luminary/Luminary, SL Dark Jade/SL Dark Jade, and Graphite/Graphite have a large Arc'teryx Bird logo on the side · The colours Atmos/Atmos and Black/Black have a smaller Arc'teryx Bird logo on the heel", "지속 가능성: PFAS(퍼- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "소재: Lining: Textile · Insole: Textile/Synthetic · Outsole: Rubber", "관리: Surface clean only"],
